From 6fdd388dc3e73383e75fd37824a74f7c3276529e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nick <nekreshen@yandex.ru>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 15:01:48 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 04/13] codegen/runtime: function_table_base moves a module's
 indirect-call table

A module's table (twice its code size plus the thunk reserve) normally follows
its image. FIFA 19's CardsDLLzf table would cover powdllzf's image, so the
codegen config can place it elsewhere (function_table_base). PPCImageInfo
carries table_base, REX_LOOKUP_FUNC uses REX_TABLE_BASE, and the dispatcher
checks images and tables against every module apart.
